<title>JAPAN: Asahi Concrete Works - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi Concrete Works - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.46		vs	    9.21</p>
<p> Operating	  567 million	 vs	  581 million</p>
<p> Current	    595 million	 vs	  642 million</p>
<p> Net		  374 million	 vs	  369 million</p>
<p> EPS		   28.30 yen	  vs	   27.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares		13 million	 vs	   13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi Concrete Works Co Ltd is a concrete product maker.</p>
